 A_notice="<h4>Notice (4 min)</h4><table class='tbl'><tr><th>Direct</th><th>Reported</th></tr><tr><td>“I am tired,” she said.</td><td>She said that she <b>was</b> tired.</td></tr><tr><td>“Do you like it?” he asked.</td><td>He asked <b>if I liked</b> it.</td></tr><tr><td>“Rest!” the doctor said.</td><td>The doctor <b>told me to rest</b>.</td></tr></table><p><b>Conditionals:</b> <i>If I had time, I would help</i> (unreal present). <i>If I had known, I would have called</i> (unreal past).</p>",
